"Intelligent Systems Program and `The Robotics Institute "
"<http://www.ri.cmu.edu/>`__ (established in 1979 to conduct basic and "
"applied research in robotic technologies), part of the `School of Computer "
"Science <http://www.cs.cmu.edu/>`__, at `Carnegie Mellon University "
"<http://www.cmu.edu/>`__."
msgstr ""
"이 프로젝트는 NASA Ames Intelligent Systems Program과 `Carnegie Mellon University "
"<http://www.cmu.edu/>`__ `School of Computer Science "
"<http://www.cs.cmu.edu/>`__\\ 의 일부인 (로봇 기술 분야의 기초 및 응용 연구를 수행하기 위해 1979년에 "
"설립된) `The Robotics Institute <http://www.ri.cmu.edu/>`__\\ 의 관대함을 통해 "
"지원되었습니다."
